  - cerebral small vessel disease
  - diffusion MRI
  - tractography
  - lesion segmentation
abstract: >
  leukoquant is a neuroimaging pipeline for lesion-informed white matter damage
  analysis in cerebral small vessel disease (CSVD). It combines brain
  parcellation, white matter hyperintensity (WMH) segmentation, tractography, diffusion MRI modelling (DTI, NODDI), and tract-level metric extraction into a unified CLI toolkit.
